        "cooked": "<p>So my signature I'm trying to change</p><p>When I encountered an error most strange</p><p>My sig must be below 255 char</p><p>Which is a rather high bar</p><p>for my sig's in the 100 char range.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Translation: &nbsp;I was trying to change my signature to</p><p>\n&gt; <span>\"Do you not know that a man is not dead while his name is still spoken?\"</span></p><p><span>- Terry Pratchett, Going Postal\n which is just over 100 characters, but I'm getting an error message that reads: \"</span><span>Your signature can't be longer than&nbsp;</span><em>255</em><span>&nbsp;characters.\"</span></p>",
